    // j_engine.md 'Step 2: the pre-contraction kernel'; [JEngine, v2, eq. 20]
    // PRECONDITION: w[k] is 2.0 for an off-diagonal ket shell pair (c != d) and
    // 1.0 for a diagonal one -- decided by the host, folded into D_q and so into
    // Dmax; this kernel never decides it. Only unique ket shell pairs c >= d are
    // records; D is symmetric (checked by the host, never symmetrised here); eta >
    // 0 (j_engine.md, 'Step 2')
