        // density='ao': D_cd is read from the AO density itself, Dao[off_c[k] + i,
        // off_d[k] + j] for the record's row r = (i, j), the values the host gathers
        // into Dcd[pair[k], r] (ao.j._kets), so the sum is the same product in the
        // same order. PRECONDITION: Dao is symmetric and off_c / off_d are the
        // record's own shells' first AOs, c the shell of momentum lc -- a pair stored
